<title>SENEGAL: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO/AFRICA ZONE GROUP 3 RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP EURO/AFRICA ZONE GROUP 3 RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DAKAR 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of singles matches in</p>
<p>Davis Cup Euro/African zone group three on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Dragan Jovanovski (Macedonia) beat Cristian Rosti (San Marino)</p>
<p>6-1 2-6 6-3</p>
<p>Baris Ergum (Turkey) beat Habtamu Kidane (Ethiopia) 6-0 6-7</p>
<p>(3-7) 6-3</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Johnny Goudenbour (Luxemburg) beat Eldar Mustafic (Bosnia) 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Jean-Noel Said (Senegal) beat Artak Harutyunyan (Armenia) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
